# What must never reach the build context.
#
# Without this the daemon is handed node_modules, every compiled class and the
# whole of .git before a single instruction runs — minutes of upload for files
# the build then ignores. The two build stages install and compile from scratch
# on purpose, so anything here that was built on a workstation would be wrong
# in the image anyway.

.git/
.gitignore

# Node — reinstalled from the lockfile in the web stage.
**/node_modules/
counterweight-web/dist/

# JVM — recompiled in the server stage.
**/target/
**/out/
*.class

# Secrets. `.env` holds the signing key and the database password, and it is
# read by compose on the host, never inside an image.
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key
*.p12

# Local state and tooling.
.claude/
.idea/
.vscode/
backups/
**/backups/
*.dump
*.log

# The other two things in this repository that the image is not.
counterweight-agent/
docs/
